  "readmeFile": "docs/readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.16 - Add LINE Messaging API support: text push/reply, raw message push/reply, multi-bot factory, webhook signature validation, and minimal API webhook helpers.\n1.0.15 - Security: bump MailKit/MimeKit to 4.16.0 to fix GHSA-9j88-vvj5-vhgr (Moderate). Convert all source files to UTF-8 (BOM) to fix CS1009 escape-sequence errors when building under .NET SDK that treats sources as UTF-8 by default.\n1.0.6 - Upgrade all NuGet dependencies to latest stable versions compatible with .NET 8: Azure.Identity 1.19.0, MailKit/MimeKit 4.15.1, Serilog 4.3.1, Serilog.AspNetCore 10.0.0, Serilog.Sinks.Console 6.1.1, Serilog.Sinks.File 7.0.0, Serilog.Sinks.MSSqlServer 9.0.3, Microsoft.Data.SqlClient 7.0.0, Microsoft.Data.Sqlite 10.0.5, System.Text.Json 10.0.5.\n1.0.5 - Internal maintenance (pack script automation).\n1.0.4 - Enhanced MailService: multi-recipient (To/Cc/Bcc) parsing, Serilog Debug integration, attachment logging, improved error messages (includes InnerException), safe recipient override in DEBUG build.\n1.0.0 - Initial release.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
